                                                "sense_id": "a907eb29-be94-31c5-910b-3382c5ee71ed",
                                                "text": "Nor brick, nor marble was the wall in view,\nBut ſhining Chriſtall, which from top to baſe\nOut of her womb a thouſand rayons threw, […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "096eb4bd-4676-4361-a5bf-45114bc517dd",
                                                "sense_id": "a907eb29-be94-31c5-910b-3382c5ee71ed",
                                                "text": "The rayons of the Sunne we see, Diminish in their strength."
                                            },
